    "enUS": {
      "description": "Ever since we escaped the war we have struggled to secure our safety, surrounded by foes on all sides, beset by constant danger.\r\n\r\nOur old holdout to the east is overrun with undead. These scourge meander mindlessly--a sad but dangerous remnant. Without the guidance of their commanders, they are lost... but still deadly.\r\n\r\nThough we've tried, we have yet to succeed in eliminating their presence. At the very least, with your help, we can push them back to secure our safety... for now.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Forgotten Soldier slain",
          "type": "monster"
